13. Commission is based on GST-inclusive discounted product price.
14. Shipping charges are excluded.
15. Referral links use Last Click Attribution.
16. Cookie duration is 30 days.
17. A valid referral can earn commission on ANY eligible product purchased during the attribution window.
18. Self-referrals are blocked automatically.
19. Order cancellation automatically cancels unpaid related commission.
20. Full refunds cancel the relevant unpaid commission.
21. Partial refunds affect only the refunded product.
22. Commission becomes Available only after Delivery and completed Return Period.
23. Suspicious commissions are held for Admin review.
24. Commission rates are snapshotted for each attributed order.
25. Separate Affiliate Wallet is required.
26. Minimum Withdrawal is ₹100.
27. Withdrawals are manually processed.
28. Withdrawal processing target is 5–7 Working Days.
29. Rejected withdrawals restore funds to Available Balance.
30. Monthly Sales Targets and Ranking Rewards are required.
31. Only Delivered orders count provisionally toward targets.
32. Sales become final after Return Period completion.
33. Cash Bonus and Special Rewards are supported.
34. All Affiliates have one common membership level.
35. Certificate and Digital ID Card are automatically generated after activation.
36. QR verification and Unique Verification Number are required.
37. Account suspension immediately disables links.
38. Suspension holds Pending and Available Commission.
39. Reactivation requires Admin approval and commission review.
40. Partner may request account closure.
41. Admin reviews closure requests.
42. On approved closure, unpaid Pending Commission is cancelled and remaining eligible Available Commission is settled.
43. Admin controls all important Affiliate Program settings.
44. Dashboard and Email notifications are required.
